  "intro": "<p>Best supplement stacking for type 2 diabetes is a carefully selected combination of evidence‑based nutrients that work together to support blood sugar regulation. By targeting insulin sensitivity, glucose uptake, and gut health, these stacks can complement lifestyle changes and help keep daily glucose levels within a healthy range. They are not a replacement for medical treatment, but they can be a useful adjunct for people looking to fine‑tune their metabolic balance.</p>\n",
